{
  "slug": "cync",
  "name": "Cync",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cync backs up and syncs your Claude Code settings to any Git repository. Push  your ~/.claude/ configuration from one machine and pull it on another — keeping CLAUDE.md, custom skills, commands, memory, and settings in sync across all your devices. Features module-based selective sync, sensitive data scanning, optional AES-256-GCM encryption, dry-run previews, and interactive conflict resolution.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 commands**.\n\n- **Commands** (5): `sync-help` (Show Claude Code Sync help), `sync-init` (Initialize Claude Code sync - connect to a GitHub repo for settings backup), `sync-pull` (Pull Claude Code settings from remote backup), `sync-push` (Push Claude Code settings to remote backup), `sync-status` (Show Claude Code sync status)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cync@claude-community` from `dev-gyus/claude-code-sync`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "command",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "devgyu"
  },
